  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed single storey rear extension, in extending past the side elevation of the building and being greater than the half width measured at the furthest width, would exceed the permitted development tolerances set out in Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town & Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015. Planning permission would therefore be required. ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed single storey rear extension, by reason of using a render finish on the side elevation that would not be visually similar to material used in the construction of the exterior of the existing dwellinghouse, would exceed the permitted development tolerances set out in Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town & Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015. Planning permission would therefore be required. "
